# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated artefacts. Everything here is rebuilt by a script in the repo,
# so committing it would only add weight and merge conflicts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# 574MB of per-airline JSON. The rosters (divisions/*/members.json) ARE
# committed - they are small and say who is in each division.
divisions/*/members/*/

# How the data is collected is kept private (October 2026): the collector,
# its checker and the notes on the game's API stay on the maintainer's
# machine and are never committed.
divisions/API.md
divisions/*.py
divisions/**/__pycache__/
divisions/proxima/members/test_instructions.md

# 132MB of CSV, rebuilt in ~40s by database/scripts/build_database.py
database/csv/

# raw open datasets; the merged extract airports_reference.json IS committed
database/reference/.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and machine-local state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
database/connection.txt
divisions/.token
# Last week's airline folders, moved aside by database/scripts/weekly.ps1.
divisions/.previous/
divisions/*/members/.token
web/.env.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
#
# web/dist is intermediate. The published site DOES live in the repository -
# index.html, 404.html and assets/ at the root - because Pages serves the root
# of main for a <name>.github.io site. web/scripts/publish-to-root.mjs puts it
# there; do not edit those files by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.claude/launch.json
